    hgTitle: "Nye County Jail Food Services Contract Award",
    hgText:
      "The Board is scheduled for discussion and deliberation regarding proposals received for RFP No. 2026-02 Jail Food Services. The agenda expressly states the County will discuss the proposals received, consider award to one of several named proposers, approve or amend and approve the contract with the selected bidder, fund the contract from 10236, Nye County Jail Fund, or reject proposals and provide direction to staff on how to proceed with the project.\n\nThe listed proposers and pricing structures are: Get Fresh Sales LLC at $7.85 per meal and 0% commissary revenue; Summit Correctional Services at $2.05 per meal and 42.5% commissary revenue; Summit Correctional Services at $2.08 per meal and 42.5% commissary revenue; Trinity Services Group at $1.91 per meal and 40% commissary revenue; Trinity Services Group at $1.84 per meal and 38% commissary revenue; or Victus Food Service at $1.66 per meal and 38% commissary revenue.\n\nThis is a clear outside procurement for food service operations at the Nye County Jail, and the item is at the contract award stage. Related vendor opportunities may include inmate meal preparation and delivery, commissary administration, food supply logistics, nutritional compliance, kitchen operations support, and correctional food service management depending on final contract structure.",
